fdroid:com.example.iperf3client.description:
iPerf3 is a tool for active measurements of the maximum achievable bandwidth on IP networks. It supports tuning of various parameters related to timing, buffers and protocols (TCP, UDP, SCTP with IPv4 and IPv6). For each test it reports the bandwidth, loss, and other parameters.
For more information, see https://github.com/esnet/iperf , which also includes the iperf3 source code (note that this repository does not include any iperf3 source code).
 iPerf3 Android client 
In general, the app is capable of:
- perform simple iperf3 upload and download tests
- Save preconfigured;
- Save test results;
- Graph transfer and bitrate;
This application does not share your personal data or geolocation, all work is offline.

bluejetty:00030636:ios.description:
MoneyTrack is a simple, focused expense tracker built around three principles: no ads, no launch ads, and no financial product recommendations. It keeps bookkeeping minimal and stays focused on recording transactions.
More than 6 million users use MoneyTrack to record transactions and understand their spending. AI-powered automatic entry records transactions accurately and efficiently, while simple charts make spending easy to understand at a glance.
【Features】
No launch ads, no ads, no financial products
【Functions】
- Quick entry: A simple workflow for recording transactions quickly;
- AI-powered automatic entry: AI accurately recognizes transactions and matches categories, assets, notes, and other details for immediate recording;
- Category management: Supports main categories and subcategories, with custom categories added as needed;
- Asset management: Supports cash, bank accounts, credit cards, stored-value cards, investment accounts, and other asset accounts;
- Statistical reports: Summarizes income and expenses from multiple perspectives to make spending easier to understand;
- Multiple ledgers: Create separate ledgers for daily life, business, renovation, travel, baby expenses, shops, and other scenarios;
- Shared ledgers: Invite family members or a partner to record together in the same ledger;
- Recurring transactions: Automatically generate repeating income and expenses such as rent, car payments, subscriptions, insurance, and salary;
- Budget management: Set monthly or yearly budgets, plan spending in advance, and avoid overspending;
- Free backup: Data syncs automatically with your account, continues after switching phones, and can be used on multiple phones;
- Free export: Export transactions at any time, including transaction images to Excel;
- Free import: Import transactions from Alipay, WeChat, and many other platforms;
- Reimbursement management: Record transactions awaiting reimbursement and manage the complete reimbursement process;
- Refunds: Apply refunds to expense transactions, link the complete transaction flow, and support multiple refunds.
- Bulk editing: Process notes, accounts, categories, tags, and other information across multiple transactions
- Tags: Add multiple tags to transactions, such as merchant, project, or city, for multidimensional management.
- Search: Find transactions by amount, time, ledger, tag, category, and other criteria;
- Multiple currencies: Includes 100+ currencies with automatic exchange-rate conversion;
- Widgets: A variety of home screen widgets makes recording more convenient;
- Quick launch mode: Open the app and enter the transaction flow automatically;
- Calendar view: View each day’s data summary clearly on a calendar;
- Privacy first: Protect data with facial authentication or a passcode to prevent access by others;
【Help and Feedback】
User guide: https://docs.qianjiapp.com
Feedback: Submit it through the “Feedback” page in the app.

